---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { pageTitle } from "../../lib/seo";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle("terms")} description="terms of service — osvant.">
  <LegalPage title="terms">
    <h2>the brand is fictional</h2>
    <p>
      osvant does not exist as a company. the collection, the batch numbers, the
      formulas and the journal are invented for a front-end engineering
      portfolio. nothing here is for sale.
    </p>

    <h2>the shop is a simulation</h2>
    <p>
      prices, stock levels and the sold-out state are read from a local data
      file. adding to cart and checking out exercise the same interface a real
      store would, then stop at a confirmation screen. no payment method is ever
      requested and no order is created.
    </p>

    <h2>use of the site</h2>
    <p>
      browse it, inspect it, take it apart. the code is a demonstration of how
      the interface is built, and it is meant to be looked at.
    </p>

    <h2>content</h2>
    <p>
      copy and design are original. photography is licensed stock, graded at
      runtime. no real fragrance house, product or person is represented, and
      any resemblance to an existing brand is unintentional.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
